  44  z(i)   "Arrival time at node i"
  45  ;
  46  Variable F;
  47  equations
  48  OF                    Distance minimization (objective function)
  49  nb1(j)                every node has only one predecessor node
  50  nb2(j)                every node has only one successor node
  51  nb3(i,j)              Subtour elimination constraint
  52  tw1(i)                Arrival time is within the time window
  53  tw2(i)                Arrival time is within the time window
  54  Time (i,j)            Arrival time calculation
  55   
  56   
  57   
  58  ;
  59   
  60   
  61  *Enter OF, nb1(j) and nb2(j) and nb3(i,j) here.
  62  OF.. F=e= sum((i,j), d_full(i,j) * x(i,j));
  63   
  64  nb1(j)..  sum(i, x(i,j))=e= 1;
  65   
  66  nb2(j)..  sum(i, x(j,i))=e= 1;
  67   
