  71  *subtour_elimination(i,j)$(ord(i)>1 and ord(j)>1 and ord(i)<> ord(j)).. u(i) - u(j) + card(v) * x(i,j) =l= card(v) - 1;
  72  nb3(i,j)$(ord(i)>1 and ord(j)>1 and ord(i)<> ord(j)).. u(i) - u(j) + (card(V)-1)*x(i,j) =L= card(V)-2 ;
  73   
  74   
  75  tw1(i).. a(i)=L=z(i);
  76  tw2(i).. z(i) =L= b(i);
  77   
  78  Time(i,j)$(ord(i) > 1 and ord(j) > 1) ..z(i) + s(i) + t(i,j) - M * (1 - x(i,j)) =L= z(j);
